  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CORE FUNDING TO MISEAN CARA, WHICH PROVIDES GRANTS TO MISSIONARY ORGANISATIONS FOR THEIR DEVELOPMENT WORK IN AFRICA, ASIA AND SOUTH AMERICA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PARTNER: Saint Patrick&apos;s Missionary Society PROJECT: The aim is to increase equity and access to primary education and strengthening systems to attain quality education particularly for learners with disabilities and girls in Malawi. This will happen through making the school environment conducive and comfortable for girls and learners with disabilities. The project will also liaise with local government and other relevant stakeholders.  . Teachers will foster an inclusive approach to education and school governing bodies will be trained in this aspect of inclusiveness.</narrative>
  </description>
